            <span>What does Uncore Digital do?</span>
            <i class="fqh-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </summary>
          <div class="fqh-item__a montserrat-regular">
            <p>
              Uncore Digital is a digital agency that helps businesses grow
              online. We offer digital marketing, product design and
              development, digital transformation, and web and app development,
              from strategy through to launch and ongoing improvement.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="fqh-item">
          <summary class="fqh-item__q poppins-bold">
            <span>How do I get started?</span>
            <i class="fqh-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </summary>
          <div class="fqh-item__a montserrat-regular">
            <p>
              Book a free consultation through our contact form or email us. We
              will talk through your goals, challenges and budget, then
              recommend the best approach and next steps.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="fqh-item">
          <summary class="fqh-item__q poppins-bold">
            <span>How much do your services cost?</span>
            <i class="fqh-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </summary>
          <div class="fqh-item__a montserrat-regular">
            <p>
              Pricing depends on the scope, complexity and timeline of your
              project, so we do not use one-size-fits-all packages. After a
              short discovery call we provide a clear, written proposal with
              costs before any work starts.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="fqh-item">
          <summary class="fqh-item__q poppins-bold">
            <span>How long does a project take?</span>
            <i class="fqh-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </summary>
          <div class="fqh-item__a montserrat-regular">
            <p>
              Timelines depend on the project. A focused marketing campaign can
              start quickly, while a custom web or mobile product takes longer.
              We give you a realistic timeline in the proposal and keep you
              updated if anything changes.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>

      <!-- Right column -->
      <div class="fqh-col">
        <details class="fqh-item">
          <summary class="fqh-item__q poppins-bold">
            <span>Do you build websites and mobile apps?</span>
            <i class="fqh-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </summary>
          <div class="fqh-item__a montserrat-regular">
            <p>
              Yes. We design and develop fast, intuitive web and mobile
              products that are built to scale, including MVPs, web apps and
              platforms. We act as an extended tech team for your business.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="fqh-item">
          <summary class="fqh-item__q poppins-bold">
            <span>Can I hire you for just one service?</span>
            <i class="fqh-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </summary>
          <div class="fqh-item__a montserrat-regular">
            <p>
              Yes. You can engage us for a single project, such as a website or
              a marketing campaign, or combine services as your needs grow.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="fqh-item">
          <summary class="fqh-item__q poppins-bold">
            <span>Do you offer support after the project launches?</span>
            <i class="fqh-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </summary>
          <div class="fqh-item__a montserrat-regular">
            <p>
              Yes. We offer ongoing support, maintenance and optimisation so
              your website, product or campaigns keep performing after launch.
              The details are agreed with you up front.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="fqh-item">
          <summary class="fqh-item__q poppins-bold">
            <span>Who owns the work you create?</span>
            <i class="fqh-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </summary>
          <div class="fqh-item__a montserrat-regular">
            <p>
              Ownership of deliverables, such as designs and code, is set out in
              the agreement we sign with you before the project begins, so there
              are no surprises.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>
